 "input": "how our team runs a sprint. product owner keeps the product backlog ordered, does refinement with the team midweek (estimates in story points). sprint planning on day 1: team picks items from the top of the backlog into the sprint backlog based on velocity from the last few sprints, and agrees a sprint goal. daily standup 15 min at the board. work is \"done\" when it meets the definition of done (tests, review, docs). sprint review at the end shows the increment to stakeholders, feedback goes back into the backlog. retro after that, actions go on the improvement list. scrum master facilitates all the meetings and tracks velocity.",
